  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 is the first production-ready release of Icod.TermInfo: a stable, dependency-free managed terminfo library for net8.0 and net10.0. It provides complete standard and extended capability semantics; conventional compiled terminfo parsing and deterministic environment/user/system discovery; explicit provider composition and caching; parameter expansion; padding-aware output; indexed/direct-RGB color helpers; built-in ANSI/DEC/xterm/Windows profiles; frozen 1.x assembly identity; XML documentation; portable symbols and Source Link; and public-API/package/fresh-consumer compatibility gates.",
